        "id": 3918196816,
        "type": "DiffNote",
        "body": "[P2] The rules acceptance cleanup can delete unrelated ship designs. It deletes every `ship_prototypes` row named `Rulesraft%` with no runtime reference, while this run creates only one `Rulesraft<timestamp>` row. If a builder already has an unused prototype named `Rulesraft Adventurer`, a successful run or recovery deletes it, and the baseline snapshot contains no prototype backup. Save the exact prototype ID created by this run and delete only that ID after checking it has no runtime reference; leave all other matching names untouched.",
