        "body": "Fixed in 5ce14ee75.\n\n- The expect session prints and flushes `rules_prototype_id=<id>` right after `vedit new`.\n- Recovery deletes only that ID, and only if the row is still a `Rulesraft` row with no runtime reference. Every other prototype is left alone, whatever its name.\n- The success check now looks for that ID instead of for the name pattern.\n- The rules gate passed again on the fixes (details in the summary note).",
