        "body": "[P3] This new validation record publishes an agent-named temporary run path. The repository rule forbids AI attribution in committed material, and a per-session `/tmp` directory is not a durable review artifact: a reviewer cannot verify the claimed transcript from this MR after that machine is cleaned. Remove the temporary path and keep the command, source revision, binary hash, and result, or link a durable neutrally named artifact if one is retained.",
