      {
        "id": 3919037146,
        "type": null,
        "body": "added 7 commits\n\n<ul><li>9b8c3eb0 - Record vessel fire grace for the gunner only</li><li>45d378d9 - Read hull levels without DDL and fail closed</li><li>5ce14ee7 - Delete only the rules gate&#39;s own shipyard prototype</li><li>7e2ad833 - Record the rules gate rerun without a temporary path</li><li>9112a729 - Compare the hull owner&#39;s name explicitly in the fire check</li><li>0f05741b - Make the Phase 18 schema apply to a fresh database</li><li>26bd5f99 - Test the vessel_owner_cap config clamp</li></ul>\n\n[Compare with previous version](/max757/Luminari-Source/-/merge_requests/6/diffs?diff_id=2059881480&start_sha=68f68c135854aa0870e95e80fbde282ad07bb5ba)",
